/T <>
/E <>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 283 0 R
/T (This is all done sustainably through local-to-local change. From our very first year, our work has been carried by our Changemakers, the local leaders who know their neighbors, their land, their culture, and their challenges better than we ever could. They are the heart of how FOREFRONT Charity works. We do not arrive with answers. We come to listen, to serve, and to cobuild something that belongs to the community long after we step back.)
/E (This is all done sustainably through local-to-local change. From our very first year, our work has been carried by our Changemakers, the local leaders who know their neighbors, their land, their culture, and their challenges better than we ever could. They are the heart of how FOREFRONT Charity works. We do not arrive with answers. We come to listen, to serve, and to cobuild something that belongs to the community long after we step back.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 283 0 R
/T (Our theme in our 10th year is "To All Parts of the World" and it is more than a phrase. It is a calling. The needs we set out to meet do not stop at a border and neither will we. This year we took our first steps into Kenya, guided by local leaders on the ground, beginning a wider chapter where the model we have built over a decade in India can take root in new soil and bear fruit in new places. It is humbling to imagine the families we have not yet met whose lives will be different because of what we choose to do together now.)
/E (Our theme in our 10th year is "To All Parts of the World" and it is more than a phrase. It is a calling. The needs we set out to meet do not stop at a border and neither will we. This year we took our first steps into Kenya, guided by local leaders on the ground, beginning a wider chapter where the model we have built over a decade in India can take root in new soil and bear fruit in new places. It is humbling to imagine the families we have not yet met whose lives will be different because of what we choose to do together now.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
