/T (I want to be honest about what this milestone means to me. Ten years is not a finish line. It is proof that hope, when it is shared, multiplies. Every water well, every medical workshop visit, every classroom, and every leader we have helped raise up is a reminder that love expressed through action changes the course of a life, a family, and a generation.)
