/T (Sustainable change continues to be driven by passionate and empowered individuals making a meaningful impact in their communities. In 2025, we deepened our Empowerment efforts in India, where persistent challenges \(such as limited access to education, gender inequality, and economic instability\) continue to hinder progress. In response, our local and US teams identified key areas for improvement across several initiatives, including the diabetes workshops.)
/E (Sustainable change continues to be driven by passionate and empowered individuals making a meaningful impact in their communities. In 2025, we deepened our Empowerment efforts in India, where persistent challenges \(such as limited access to education, gender inequality, and economic instability\) continue to hinder progress. In response, our local and US teams identified key areas for improvement across several initiatives, including the diabetes workshops.)
