/E (One notable enhancement was the introduction of one-on-one consultations with a nurse at the conclusion of each workshop, allowing participants to discuss additional health concerns. To further support community health, basic over-the-counter medications were made available and prescribed by attending medical professionals, addressing common issues such as gastrointestinal discomfort.)
