593 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 306 0 R
/T (Our total expenditures in 2025 were $484,995, a modest 8% increase over 2024, resulting in a net surplus of $24,529, a meaningful turnaround from the \($38,694\) deficit we absorbed in 2024. That prior-year deficit was the planned cost of completing our school building expansion. In 2025, with that construction largely behind us, our financial position recovered and strengthened. The $63,000 positive swing in net revenue year-over-year reflects both disciplined spending and the generosity of donors who rallied behind our 10th anniversary.)
/E (Our total expenditures in 2025 were $484,995, a modest 8% increase over 2024, resulting in a net surplus of $24,529, a meaningful turnaround from the \($38,694\) deficit we absorbed in 2024. That prior-year deficit was the planned cost of completing our school building expansion. In 2025, with that construction largely behind us, our financial position recovered and strengthened. The $63,000 positive swing in net revenue year-over-year reflects both disciplined spending and the generosity of donors who rallied behind our 10th anniversary.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [2]
>>
