/Title (Ten years ago, FOREFRONT began with a simple conviction. Every person, no matter where they are born, deserves clean water, good medical care, quality education, and the chance to shape their own future. We started in one rural community in India with more hope than resources and a deep belief that lasting change is built one village at a time.)
