/Title (In 2025, FOREFRONT Charity received $509,062 in total revenue, our highest ever and a 28% increase over 2024. This was driven by a remarkable 52% increase in direct donations, rising from $277,101 in 2024 to $421,062 in 2025. The most striking growth came from our individual donors, whose contributions nearly doubled, up 81% from $177,311 to $320,019. Corporate contributions held steady at $101,043. Grant funding came in at $88,000, a reflection of our intentional shift toward deepening individual donor relationships and reducing dependence on any single revenue stream. We are grateful to each donor, corporate partner, and grant-making organization whose investment in our mission powered this record year.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1592 0 R
/Next 1622 0 R
>>
