/Title (This is all done sustainably through local-to-local change. From our very first year, our work has been carried by our Changemakers, the local leaders who know their neighbors, their land, their culture, and their challenges better than we ever could. They are the heart of how FOREFRONT Charity works. We do not arrive with answers. We come to listen, to serve, and to cobuild something that belongs to the community long after we step back.)
