/Title (Our theme in our 10th year is "To All Parts of the World" and it is more than a phrase. It is a calling. The needs we set out to meet do not stop at a border and neither will we. This year we took our first steps into Kenya, guided by local leaders on the ground, beginning a wider chapter where the model we have built over a decade in India can take root in new soil and bear fruit in new places. It is humbling to imagine the families we have not yet met whose lives will be different because of what we choose to do together now.)
